{"ref":"character:arca-ladonna","lead":[{"k":"p","c":["Arca Ladonna is a playable character from the base game version of Vampire Survivors that was introduced in Patch 0.2.0. His starting weapon is ",{"i":"Sprite-Fire_Wand.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:fire-wand"}," ",{"t":"Fire Wand","r":"weapon:fire-wand"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["4 November 2021 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Arca"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["CIRO"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Fire_Wand.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:fire-wand"}," ",{"t":"Fire Wand","r":"weapon:fire-wand"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Get ",{"t":"Fire Wand","r":"weapon:fire-wand"}," to level 4."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[["No"]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Might","cells":[["+10%"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["The player can unlock this character by getting the Fire Wand to level 4, then purchasing this character with ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Arca can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"noneladonna\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Arca starts with +10% ",{"i":"Sprite-Spinach.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:might"}," ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"},". He also gains -5% ",{"i":"Sprite-Empty_Tome.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"}," every 10 levels until level 30. The maximum Cooldown reduction gained this way is -15%."]},{"k":"p","c":["The following table shows how much Cooldown reduction he gains by level:"]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Levels"],"h":1},{"c":["Cooldown"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["1-9"]},{"c":["0%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["10-19"]},{"c":["-5%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["20-29"]},{"c":["-10%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["30+"]},{"c":["-15%"]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["The explosion effect for ",{"i":"Sprite-Fire_Wand.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:fire-wand"}," ",{"t":"Fire Wand","r":"weapon:fire-wand"}," or ",{"i":"Sprite-Hellfire.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:hellfire"}," ",{"t":"Hellfire","r":"weapon:hellfire"}," from ",{"i":"Sprite-Heart_of_Fire_(XIX).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:heart-of-fire-xix"}," ",{"t":"Heart of Fire (XIX)","r":"weapon:heart-of-fire-xix"}," is very useful in the early game. It is advisable to select it as the first Arcana."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"gallery-sprites","title":"Sprites","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Arca_Ladonna.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Default Arca sprite."]},{"i":"Sprite-Arca_Ladonna_(Legacy).png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Legacy Arca sprite."]}]}]},{"id":"gallery-animated-sprites","title":"Animated sprites","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Animated-Arca_Ladonna.gif","w":105,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation of default Arca."]},{"i":"Animated-Arca_Ladonna_(Legacy).gif","w":109,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation of legacy Arca."]}]}]}]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 23 June 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Default skin added to game."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 12 December 2021 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added walking animation for Arca."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 4 November 2021 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Arca is Italian for \"ark\", and Ladonna is Italian for \"the woman\", a reference to ",{"t":"Arc the Lad","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arc_the_Lad_(video_game)"},", a JRPG starring the titular Arc."]},{"c":["Arca's complete name is \"Arca Ladonna,\" which when combined with ",{"i":"Sprite-Porta_Ladonna.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:porta-ladonna"}," ",{"t":"Porta's","r":"character:porta-ladonna"}," name closely resembles the Italian expression \"Porca Madonna,\" a blasphemy which heavily insults the ",{"t":"Virgin Mary","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mary,_mother_of_Jesus"}," relating her to a sow."]},{"c":["\"Arca Ladonna\" in Italian sounds like \"'orca Madonna\", which is a regional variant on the blasphemous idiom \"Porca Madonna\""]},{"c":["Arca also seems to heavily reference ",{"t":"Alucard","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alucard_(Castlevania)"}," from the ",{"t":"Castlevania","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castlevania"}," series, his name being not far off, his outfit and hairstyle appearing similar, and his starting weapon being similar to Alucard's ",{"t":"Hellfire","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Hellfire"}," spell from ",{"t":"Castlevania: Symphony of the Night","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castlevania:_Symphony_of_the_Night"},"."]}]}],"subs":[{"id":"trivia-in-other-media","title":"In other media","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Arca Ladonna makes an appearance in the idle farming simulation game ",{"t":"Rusty's Retirement","x":"https://rustys-retirement.fandom.com/wiki/Rusty%27s_Retirement"},", as part of that game's update that includes Vampire Survivors content. He is a reskin of ",{"t":"Splunk","x":"https://rustys-retirement.fandom.com/wiki/Splunk"}," in that game."]}]}]}]}]}